// Corvin's Claim: a long away mission on three maps, with no Python.
//
// The ship holds at Kesh Relay. The landing party beams down to a mining claim on the
// rock below it: `ground/camp.tiles`, `ground/works.tiles` and `ground/gallery.tiles`.
//
// A record is `### [Display Name](key)`, an optional `---` fenced block of fields, then
// body prose. Comments are `//` - note that .mast uses `#` instead.

# [Corvin's Claim](corvins_claim)


// ---- The crew: who sits at each console, and so who goes down.
