// ---- Scenes.
## [Scenes](scenes)

### [Ada Corvin](corvin)
%{learned told < 1} "You took your time." She does not look round from the radio. "Four of mine are under that hill. Ask me what you need and then go."
%{learned told} "You know what I know." She turns the radio up. Three knocks, a pause, three knocks.

- [Ask what happened](corvin_fall) if learned told < 1 ; accepts rescue, accepts rescue/power, learn told
- [Ask why the lift is dead](corvin_lift) if learned told
- [Ask what is in the stores](corvin_stores) if learned told ; reveal stores_key
- [Leave her to the radio]()

### [Nine Hours Ago](corvin_fall)
% "The lower gallery roof let go at the end of the night shift. Reth crawled out. The other four are behind it, and the fans stopped when it fell. They have air for half an hour. Less, now."

- [Ask her something else](corvin)
- [Go]()

### [The Hauler](corvin_lift)
% "The ore hauler. Its guidance burned out in the fall, and it tore the coupling out of the lift on its way past. It is still dragging it round the lift house. Stun it and you have eight seconds."

- [Ask her something else](corvin)
- [Go]()

### [The Stores](corvin_stores)
% "Jacks, for holding a roof up. And quarry charges, if you would rather bring it down." She nods at a nail by her door. "Key. Use the charges and I have no mine. Use them anyway."

- [Ask her something else](corvin)
- [Go]()

### [The Gallery Plan](plan)
% The lower gallery is one straight drive. Somebody has inked a cross where it meets an older working, and written beside it: OLD SEAM. ROOF GOOD HERE.

- [Copy it down]() ; learn plan

### [The Lift Console](lift)
% A lever, a dead lamp, and a socket with torn cable ends hanging out of it. Without its coupling the lift is a cage on a rope.

- [Fit the coupling](lift_runs) if holding coupling ; take coupling
- [Leave it]()

### [The Drum Turns](lift_runs)
% The lamp comes up amber, then green. Behind you the winding drum takes up its slack with a groan, and the cage gate unlocks.

- [Step back]() ; signal lift_running

### [The Ventilator](vent)
% Every breaker is down. The fans did what they were built to do when the roof fell: they stopped, so they would not feed a fire.

- [Reset the breakers](vent_runs)
- [Leave it]()

### [Air](vent_runs)
% One handle at a time. Far below, something big begins to turn, and the dust on the panel starts to drift toward the lift shaft.

- [Step back]() ; signal air_moving, learn air

### [Jo Reth](reth)
% "They are alive. I can hear them." He has one leg out straight, and he is not looking at it. "Do not ask me to walk you there."

- [Ask where the others are](reth_where)
- [Set his leg](reth_leg) if skill medical >= 3 ; signal reth_treated, learn seam
- [Leave him]()

### [Behind the Fall](reth_where)
% "End of the drive. Thirty paces of rock, and them on the other side of it. Put your ear to it."

- [Ask him something else](reth)
- [Leave him]()

### [The Thin Place](reth_leg)
% He bites down on his glove while you work. When he can talk again he says: "Left side, by the old seam. The fall is thin there. I got out through it before it closed."

- [Leave him]()

### [The Rock Fall](fall)
%{learned air < 1} A slope of broken rock from floor to roof. The air is thick here, and your lamp burns low.
%{learned air} A slope of broken rock from floor to roof. There is a draft on your face now, and your lamp burns clean.

- [Listen at the rock](fall_listen) ; signal fall_reached
- [Shore the roof and dig](fall_shore) if learned >= 4
- [Set the charges](fall_charges) if holding charges ; take charges
- [Step back]()

### [Three Knocks](fall_listen)
% Three knocks, a pause, three knocks. You knock back, and for a moment there is nothing. Then all four of them are hammering at once.

- [Step back](fall)

### [Where to Dig](fall_shore)
% You know where the fall is thin, where the roof is good, and that there is air to work in. What you need now is steel to hold the roof while you dig under it.

- [Set the jacks and dig](fall_dig) if holding jacks ; take jacks
- [Step back](fall)

### [Through](fall_dig)
% The jacks take the weight with a sound like a ship settling. An hour of rock comes out in ten minutes, and then a hand comes through the gap, and takes yours.

- [Bring them up]() ; completes rescue/dig

### [Four Charges](fall_charges)
% Quarry charges: all push and no manners. Set as they are, they will open the fall and bring the roof down behind it.

- [Fire them as they are](fall_blast)
- [Shape them to spare the roof](fall_shaped) if skill security >= 3
- [Pack them up again](fall) ; give charges

### [The Gallery Goes](fall_blast)
% The fall goes out like a cork. Four gray figures come through the dust at a run, and you run with them, and the roof follows all of you to the foot of the lift.

- [Bring them up]() ; completes rescue/blast

### [A Door in the Rock](fall_shaped)
% Two charges, not four, and turned to face each other. The bang is small and flat. When the dust settles there is a hole the size of a door, and the roof has not moved.

- [Bring them up]() ; completes rescue/dig
